# Cloudflare Pages (also honoured by Netlify).
#
# One canonical host. www is a common habit to type, so it must resolve — but
# serving the same site on two hosts splits search ranking between them, so
# it redirects rather than mirrors.
https://www.fatimaalico.com/*    https://fatimaalico.com/:splat    301

# Client-side routing: every unmatched path serves the shell at 200, or
# /about and /contact 404 on refresh and on every link a client is sent.
/*    /index.html    200
